#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpanner.rst:16 8dc2c30214a7424d98de125ab94c625b
msgid "Stereo panner for positioning audio in the stereo field."
msgstr "左右声像控制。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpanner.rst:21 5d866790a0c849a49a57101fc7e55669
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpanner.rst:23 3d675278168846e3bc2bba9ce20e9742
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectPanner is a stereo panning effect that controls the position of audio in the left-"
"right stereo field. It uses FMOD's PAN DSP to distribute the signal between the left and right "
"channels."
msgstr "**FmodAudioEffectPanner**    提供简单的左右声像偏移。   ``pan``    为负时偏左，为正时偏右，适合 2D UI 声音、非空间化音效或总线级声像调整。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpanner.rst:25 bee04178b1044f28b4091d92efcdea9c
msgid ""
"A pan value of 0.0 centers the audio equally in both channels. Negative values move the audio "
"toward the left channel, while positive values move it toward the right channel."
msgstr "声像为 0.0 时左右声道均衡；负值偏向左声道，正值偏向右声道。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpanner.rst:27 4b2559eb477d49f7a49fa754d4664e87
msgid ""
"This effect simulates Godot's AudioEffectPanner and provides a simple way to spatialize mono or "
"stereo audio in a 2D stereo soundstage."
msgstr "模拟 Godot 的 AudioEffectPanner，用于在二维立体声声场中调整单声道或立体声音频的位置。"

