#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpanner.rst:75 36aaf7d2adbd4303a0a1e532781adc66
msgid ""
"The pan position in the stereo field. Range: -1.0 to 1.0. Default: 0.0. A value of -1.0 sends the"
" signal fully to the left channel, 0.0 is centered (equal in both channels), and 1.0 sends the "
"signal fully to the right channel. Values in between provide smooth positioning."
msgstr "声像位置，负值偏左，正值偏右"

